# Regrowth, the prepare spell (CR 722): "Return target card from your graveyard to your hand." With nothing in Bot1's graveyard it cannot be cast at all (refusal; both Forests untapped to pay for it). After Lightning Bolt it can,
# but not on the Island in Bot2's graveyard (refusal, the opponent's card), only on the Bolt (the positive control), which returns to Bot1's hand.

